### What are common interview follow-up questions?

- How does UUIDv7 compare to UUIDv4 for index performance? (v7 is time-ordered so inserts are sequential; v4 is random and causes page splits.)
- Can you use UUIDv7 for pagination? (Yes, for rough cursor-based pagination, but not for strict ordering across nodes.)
- What about UUIDv6? (Similar to v7 but reorders the fields of v1; v7 is the modern choice.)
